Algorithm~\ref{alg_detect_fault} details the error detection using normal state sequences. 
This process compares $\FIRINGRECORD$—a chronological record of state transition during a fault injection simulation—with $\NORMALSEQ$, obtained via Algorithm~\ref{alg_normal_seq}. 
