Lastly, we evaluate the effectiveness of the techniques specially designed for \textsf{Vbox}.

\noindent{\bf Transitive Closure Construction.}
Figure~\ref{fig:construct-closure} shows the time for constructing the full transitive closure by Warshall's, Purdom's and Italino's algorithms and the time for constructing the compact transitive closure by our improved Purdom's (Purdom+) and our improved Italino's algorithm (Italino+). Note that Italino and Italino+ construct the transitive closure by adding edges one by one.

