\stitle{Datasets:} We use the same datasets as the existing works~\cite{lee2007extending, shetiya2020astrid, aytimur2024lplm}, % 可再补点引用
sampling author names (DBLP-AN) from DBLP\footnote{https://dblp.org}, actor names (IMDB-AN) from IMDB\footnote{https://imdb.com}, movie titles (IMDB-MT) from IMDB and part names (TPCH-PN) from TPCH\footnote{https://www.tpc.org/tpch/}. These four datasets have a small alphabet, thus we include the WIKI dataset which is used in DREAM~\cite{kwon2022cardinality} to analyze method's scalability for larger character sets. %Besides, to avoid deliberate selecting datasets, we add WIKI datasets, which is applied as a test set in~\cite{kwon2022cardinality}. 
