    \textbf{Top left}: Optimal mean-square generalisation error predicted by the theory reported in the main text (solid blue) versus the branch obtained from the simplified ansatz~\eqref{eq:gaussPS2} (solid red); the green solid line shows the universal branch corresponding to $\mathcal{Q}_W \equiv 0$, and empty circles are HMC results with informative initialisation. 
