The expression \eqref{eq:WZ-sum} suggests using the scalar structure of Sec.~\ref{sec:scalar-models} in parallel with different $A_i$, $M_i$ for each source pair $X_{V,i},Y_{V,i}$, $i=1,\dots,\ddim$. 
