We move on to apply Algorithm~\ref{alg:dynamictaylor}. For readability, we choose $N=2$ as the degree of the expansion. Note the accuracy rises with increasing degree, as we find in Section~\ref{sect:experiment}. For illustration, every step is carried out for $t=1$ below. Note $\tau_1=-c_{EL}L(t)-c_{EA}A(t)$, $\tau_2=-c_{PA}A(t)$.
